{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a <strong>wide variety</strong> of <strong>building</strong> types to develop your island. Each building has its own <strong>area of effect</strong> and can either <strong>boost</strong> or <strong>negatively affect</strong> the <strong>scores</strong> of other buildings in that area. The <strong>total score</strong> of all the buildings on your island will affect how much <strong>currency</strong> you receive <strong>each turn</strong>. Currency can then be used to <strong>buy more buildings</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.poster.avif?t=1759878858\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.webm?t=1759878858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.mp4?t=1759878858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategically</strong> place buildings next to each for a <strong>bigger score boost</strong>. A bigger score means <strong>more currency</strong>. More currency means you can <strong>buy more buildings</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Strategize</u></strong> -&gt; <strong><u>Place Buildings</u></strong> -&gt; <strong><u>Boost Score</u></strong> -&gt; <strong><u>Collect Currency</u></strong> -&gt; <strong><u>Repeat</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/5b06afdf71e716bbe538d7db9f86c082.poster.avif?t=1759878858\" width=600 height=300 ><s